  "description": "Coordination primitives for tuning a NinoTNC + radio pair with the two ends apart: the tuning-telegram protocol (ITuningLink), an SDM flavour riding the radio's own side channel (M0LTE.Radio.IRadioSideChannel; Tait CCDI short data messages: radio-native FFSK, independent of the TNC mode/pot under tune), a WebSocket flavour with a PIN-rendezvous relay, the shared meter/tuned assistant loop, a mode-coordination protocol (propose/confirm/commit a TNC mode + radio channel switch, probe-verify, revert-to-home on failure), and a capability doctor for the whole TNC-to-radio stack. Source: github.com/packet-net/packet.net.",
